0f&oh=00_AQMgzsG-DTiPTXFCts8LbNfIHKGATdvGlRpX6yfWmNxU4w&oe=6AD236F4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BazFlyingSimLandscape.png", "id": "1076508848422176", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620497_1076508851755509_1889535716678257135_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gRvzPoC9ouYQ7kNvwEiAMnG&_nc_oc=AdqOYSNkge23DuSXJ59ukslQ7kDiI2DMCVjDKTUyG8OODDKcMRIwVf6ckRytyy8CSHw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPmVnWqUOw8XbnX62rlg5tHG0fvc34hY-nInP-Eafzxtw&oe=6AD24408"}, "display_name": "Baz Flying Sim", "keywords": ["fly", "hero", "speed", "power", "flight"], "long_description": "Hello I am Baz and this is my flying sim. This is a game where you can go **really** fast with no physics constraints. You can learn how to do barrel rolls, backflips, frontflips, and more. \n\nAt first you'll probably fly like a drunk superhero, but once you get the hang of it you'll be weaving between buildings and taking the riskiest paths.\n{2021849055872870}\n# There are several gamemodes available\nYou can fly in an infinite procedurally generated city, you can fly with random people in multiplayer, and you can even fly around the Earth.\n\n\n{27426045023730544}\nThis is me flying in New York City using Googles Photorealistic 3D Tiles, but you can enter your own coordinates and fly anywhere in the world.\n\n# But wait, theres more\nThere's destruction physics for every building. Fly too fast? Have fun going through 12 buildings.\n\n{1526962579125192}\n# Take revenge on the buildings\nYou have an arsenal of tools to help you, including this cool laser\n\n{864954782959611}\n\nThere's also like different powers and abilities and weapons, but yeah this is just the main stuff. That's all", "short_description": "Realistic hand propulsion flying simulator. Fly in an infinite city or through 3D scans of the Earth"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.c